nnual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Management reported strong operational and financial performance for Q1 FY27, highlighted by continuous drilling execution and favorable commodity strength. Average sales stood at 1,705 boepd alongside a quarter-on-quarter inventory build-up of approximately 6,500 boepd due to limited custody transfer days. The company reiterated its full-year guidance of reaching 2,500 boepd in FY27 supported by upcoming frac campaigns. Furthermore, EBITDA surged to approximately Rs 93.2 Cr with an EBITDA margin of around 70%. Antelopus Selan reported its annual results for FY 2025-26, highlighting an increase in average sales volumes to 1,355 boepd and an exit rate exceeding 1,800 boepd.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management noted a roadmap to 2,500+ boepd in FY 27 starting from a base of 1800+ boepd.","quote":"We begin our FY 27 with a base of 1800+ boepd with a road map to 2500+ boepd in FY ‘27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"},{"claim":"The company stated it remains firm on its production ramp-up trajectory supported by contributions across the onshore portfolio.","quote":"We remain firm on our production ramp-up trajectory, supported by contributions across our onshore portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=972a7384-75ac-4f04-bf73-e9a43e4eefe9.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management reported a volume-driven growth despite a challenging pricing environment.","quote":"Volume-driven growth despite a challenging pricing environment","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"}],"capex_expa